  <item>
    <title>EP.011 莫干山弹了一夜｜那些年我们练的吉他</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac51bbf195d838e2aedef60</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac51bbf195d838e2aedef60</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 19:35:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpdXzsABA1d8jq-kvm9rGSGGRcHT.jpg"><p><span>新一期弹唱播客来啦！本期主题「我和吉他」，因为我和大家的相识都是因为弹吉他和音乐，所以邀请到上一期的嘉宾们，在莫干山民宿重新聚齐，一起聊聊我们和吉他的故事——什么时候开始学的、第一首弹了什么歌、第一把琴还在不在、哪个和弦让我们惊艳过、第一次攻克的难度曲是哪一首、还有哪些歌是这辈子弹起来就觉得值的。一群人围炉夜话，边聊边弹，不知不觉又录了将近3个小时……</span></p><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>老黄/小潘/Gonglang/Hann/老胡</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lubwllv64WkFD_ItxmaO26-6v6iW.JPG"></figure><p></p><p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>什么原因接触 / 学习吉他 + 第一首弹唱的歌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">00:10:51</a>&nbsp;小步舞曲 - 陈绮贞</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">00:16:20</a>&nbsp;对面的女孩看过来 - 任贤齐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">00:18:40</a>&nbsp;小明 - 余佳运</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">00:23:45</a>&nbsp;after 17 - 陈绮贞</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span>好听的和弦分享</span></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">00:30:32</a>爱我别走（C9 和弦代表） - 张震岳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">00:34:00</a>嫉妒（Eadd9 和弦代表） - 陈绮贞</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">00:39:50</a>&nbsp;夜盲症（Em11 和弦代表） - 蔡健雅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">00:41:15</a>&nbsp;达尔文（Em11 和弦代表） - 蔡健雅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2924">00:48:44</a> 路口（Asus2 和弦代表） - 张震岳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">00:52:30</a>&nbsp;你心里最后一个（Esus2 和弦代表） - 苏打绿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">00:59:00</a> 大人中 - 卢广仲</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p><span>聊聊第一把吉他 + 它还在吗</span></p></li><li><p><span>攻克的难度歌曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3765">01:02:45</a>&nbsp;爱在西元前 - 周杰伦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4410">01:13:30</a>&nbsp;红豆 - 方大同</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4950">01:22:30</a>&nbsp;多得他 - 王菲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5090">01:24:50</a>&nbsp;刻在我心底的名字 - 卢广仲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5160">01:26:00</a> 男音 - 方大同</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5425">01:30:25</a>&nbsp;Best Part - Daniel Caesar</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5550">01:32:30</a>&nbsp;Who Knows - Daniel Caesar</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5820">01:37:00</a>&nbsp;校园歌手 - 卢广仲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6085">01:41:25</a>&nbsp;表面的和平 - 陈绮贞</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6330">01:45:30</a>&nbsp;旅行的意义 - 陈绮贞</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6720">01:52:00</a>&nbsp;If We Were Vampires - Jason Isbell</span></p></li></ul><p><span>每次弹起来都觉得感动 / 幸福 / 鼓舞自己的歌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6925">01:55:25</a>&nbsp;不再让你孤单 - 陈升</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7225">02:00:25</a>&nbsp;天黑黑 - 孙燕姿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7440">02:04:00</a>&nbsp;十年一刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7420">02:03:40</a>&nbsp;一定要相信自己 - 卢广仲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8160">02:16:00</a> 我们的皇冠 - 卢凯彤</span></p><ul><li><p><span>自由弹唱时间（发疯警告）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8330">02:18:50</a>&nbsp;会呼吸的痛 - 梁静茹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8595">02:23:15</a>&nbsp;春风吹 + Loving You - 方大同</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8717">02:25:17</a> instagram DEAN </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9000">02:30:00</a> 淘汰 - 陈奕迅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9260">02:34:20</a> Happy Chakra 卢广仲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9360">02:36:00</a> 坚持到底 - 阿杜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9575">02:39:35</a>&nbsp;爱就一个字 - 张信哲</span></p></li><li><p></p></li></ul><p><span>大条的第一把烧火棍：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiuhJA0W8wbV0r9-C760DOgPZdKK.JPG"></figure><p><span>大条的第二把琴，买入800，850卖出：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrTtyKlQ14nvQRIA8m3SwvbSJ8O8.jpg"></figure><p><span>----还可以在这里找到我噢------</span></p><p><span>Bilibibli：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/59148927" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/59148927"><span>P大条大条</span></a><span> （弹唱/Vlog）</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5481bf26d6e4a9791265a12b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5481bf26d6e4a9791265a12b"><span>大条大条</span></a><span>（弹唱/Vlog/日常）</span></p><p><span>抖音：大条大条（弹唱）</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
