    <title>EP.007 春暖花开，和江浙沪的朋友们一起春游！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e573c18eecdbeb608b3dc1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e573c18eecdbeb608b3dc1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Mar 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天气开始暖和，樱花🌸也陆续开了，忍不住想出门走走，这次约了江浙沪区的几个朋友一起相约无锡爬冠嶂古道，提前一晚到达无锡的民宿后我们就在大厅围坐一起弹琴唱歌，播客录制也是临时决定开麦，在大家没有任何准备的情况下，会唱什么歌呢？</span></p><p><span>春天了，大家都去哪里春游呢？</span></p><h2><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></h2><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3031459" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3031459"><span>徐胃痛</span></a><span> （南京）</span></p><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/264249360?spm_id_from=333.1387.follow.user_card.click" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/264249360?spm_id_from=333.1387.follow.user_card.click"><span>花老师</span></a><span>（南京）</span></p><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/28103931" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/28103931"><span>网友小潘</span></a><span>（扬州）</span></p><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/8044835" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/8044835"><span>Mia</span></a><span>（上海）</span></p><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/59148927/upload/video" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/59148927/upload/video"><span>大条</span></a><span>（上海）</span></p><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/2993446" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/2993446"><span>黄老师</span></a><span>（上海）</span></p><p><span>中国机长（最忠实观众）（广州）</span></p><p><span>期待和更多的朋友一起录节目呀～</span></p><h2><br></h2><h2><strong><span>本期播客歌单：</span></strong></h2><p><span>你根本不是我的谁 - 卢凯彤</span></p><p><span>花的姿态 - 陈绮贞</span></p><p><span>口水流下来 - 卢凯彤</span></p><p><span>腐朽 - 陈绮贞</span></p><p><span>没啥好说 - 方大同</span></p><p><span>melody - 陶喆</span></p><p><span>王八蛋 - 陶喆</span></p><p><span>my anata - 陶喆</span></p><p><span>一念之间 - 陶喆</span></p><p><span>dear god - 陶喆</span></p><p><span>一口 - 丁世光</span></p><p><span>好心分手 - 卢巧音</span></p><p><span>火鸟功 - 陶喆</span></p><p><span>理想人生 - 徐佳莹</span></p><p><span>鱼仔 - 卢广仲</span></p><p><span>不想睡 &nbsp;- 梁静茹</span></p><p><span>鱼 - 陈绮贞</span></p><p><span>Simon - 丁世光</span></p><p><span>惧高症-徐佳莹</span></p><p><span>别送我回家 - 陈绮贞</span></p><p><span>慢歌三 - 陈绮贞</span></p><p><span>我想你要走了 - 张悬</span></p><p><span>灵感 - 陈绮贞</span></p><p><span>等等 - 卢凯彤</span></p><p><span>会不会 - 陈绮贞</span></p><p><span>一个彩蛋</span></p><h2><br></h2><h2><span>更多故事：</span></h2><p><span>小潘拿出了他刚购入的新乐器OP1 —— 价值1w元的响指：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo7VpGft0rYvCCdK3fzcRJI4e2Fk.JPG"></figure><p><span>带着吉他爬山，我们登顶啦！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgoILr3I5D9xNycKDdNgLAX_8Gnj.JPG"></figure><p><span>爬山爬累了就随地大小唱，又可以带着满满能量上路</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_o04NNEkq75Sk-Gd_q2VRYE3VX.jpg"></figure><p><span>在山脚下随便找的一块空地，拿出各自的家伙，开始惬意的music time！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnbIGceKMW_UIGcpIdiSR-JF3ehT.JPG"></figure><p><span>《吉他手睡了》</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDiwfBl9JcVpRnBEBiQ1-wlSUAa.JPG"></figure><p><span>大地就是最好的桌子</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftna3m8S-Huf8o4dqeEyI6251Xa5.JPG"></figure><p><span>---还可以在这里找到我噢------</span></p><p><span>Bilibibli：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/59148927" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/59148927"><span>P大条大条</span></a><span> （弹唱/Vlog）</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5481bf26d6e4a9791265a12b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5481bf26d6e4a9791265a12b"><span>大条大条</span></a><span>（弹唱/Vlog/日常）</span></p><p><span>公众号：大条弹吉他（很久没有更新谱子了）</span></p>]]></description>
